[Music]  hello and welcome to Playstation grenade  today marks the biggest update to hit  Battle Royale since its inception just  over 100 days ago I've delved into the  two point two points on patch notes and  have found 20 things I think you should  know of course we don't just tell you  the news we show you the difference the  update brings you ready let's do this  let's start with the most obvious the  biggest additions are the five new named  areas on the map junk Junction haunted  hills snobby shores shifty shafts and  the humongous tilted towers but these  aren't the only new additions north of  flush factory are a few new areas and  all over the maps likes changes to  abandoned buildings and solitary  settlements have been brought in in the  coming weeks I'll be looking for all  those brand spanking new loot chests and  more importantly I'll be bringing videos  to help you with Luke runs for easier  victories but for now let's have a look  at what else has changed in patch two  point 2.0 the sculpt AR may be dead to a  great deal of us but this under loved  Beauty has received an upgraded  crosshair when aiming down the sights  the new scope definitely improved target  position but I don't know if it's enough  to warrant taking one with you  additionally scoped a ARS will no longer  be found in air drops hallelujah this  should make those balloon drops highly  desirable once again the snowball  launcher and all the Christmas trees  lovely gifts underneath have now gone  and the original grenade launcher has  returned there are some great  improvements to life in Battle Royale  which may seem inconsequential but  believe me they will make a difference  for example it is now possible to  continue aiming your weapon after  jumping from Heights no longer will you  be forced to release and reapply the aim  button has this ever happened to you  well that shouldn't happen anymore as  loot will no longer land in the same  space as the chest  similarly if you've ever tried to Reza's  teammate but repeatedly found yourself  picking up loot next to their dining  corpse and fear no more this has been  rectified building has been slightly  improved to streetlights and chests no  longer prevent you from building over  the top this maid fights in Pleasant  Park and greasy Grove a little bit  difficult at times  friendly fire has now been disabled so  team killing Walt happens for at least a  few weeks this is a great time to learn  how to rock it right as you want to each  other to smithereens so give it a go  have you noticed it's quite difficult to  shoot someone in water well water will  no longer prevent bullet penetration so  this means kills at loot Lake should be  little less frustrating speaking of  water new animations have been added and  the ability to look under water has been  removed here's a really cool new  addition sniper kills will now display  the distance the shot was taken from so  I'm expecting my twitter feed to be  filled with screenshots of ridiculous  kill distances speaking of distance the  terribly low res far distances you've  seen down your sniper barrel will be  somewhat improved with this update maybe  just maybe that slice of toast in the  distance is real and not a mirage The  Weekly star will now update twice a week  and include more vanity items than ever  epic are cashing in on our desire to  stand out from the crowd so stock up on  the books  dusty Depot now has additional  ammo crates to plunder another huge  update comes in the shape of resources  and those shipping containers they yield  far more metal than they once did before  the update we received 27 metal for our  workload and now we receive 25 okay so  maybe this is still a bit hit-and-miss  I tried different containers and some  gave up 247 maybe we should keep an eye  on this one so expect more action at  this location in the future low times on  console and PC have been improved  remarkably we are told ps4 and Xbox have  twice the speed of past updates this  optimisation should improve things  across the board most noticeably those  texture pop-in should be a little less  noticeable the frustrating bug which  makes your own footsteps echo or double  up has been removed so now you don't  have to be scared of your own footsteps  another bug which has finally been  removed is the bullet whizzing noises  which happen unexpectedly and frighten  the [ __ ] out of all of us and personally  my favorite the cartoony world has  received new grass and foliage to frolic  through I know it means nothing to you  but I bloody well love it thank you epic  games so there you go 20 updates brought  in in patch 2 point 2.0 fortnight is  going from strength to strength I'll be  back very soon with new loot runs and  more Battle Royale  action I'm Adam from Playstation grenade  it's been a pleasure I'll see you next  time

